ily jumping out of  the ring forfeiting the fight the final  and most powerful transformation for  Roshi however is his full power state  where there's a dramatic increase in  muscle mass with seemingly no drawback  in speed in this state he can manipulate  and use his key attacks at maximum power  one of the only drawbacks to this form  is its stamina consumption it's just not  built to last  some examples include destroying Fire  Mountain blowing up the moon and more  recently fighting freezes army in  resurrection if that said unfortunately  there is no official power reading for  this form there is however a way to  figure it out or at the very least get  as close as I possibly can in Dragon  Ball super as listed earlier Roshi  participated in the battle against  freezes army in the resurrection of F  Ark in this section of the show Master  Roshi stands alongside the other Z  warriors as they face 170 Frieza  soldiers each so using freezes army as a  reference point it's time for some good  old-fashioned mental gymnastics let's  see if we can't get some good ol logic  going so the first thing that we need to  do is we need to figure out the average  strength of a freezer force soldier now  the official power levels are given for  characters like dodoria Saban and Kui  but these are referencing freezes elite  members and are the best of the best  within the freeze of force definitely  not common foot soldiers but thankfully  in Dyson qu 7 there is reference to  these two gentlemen banana and Tsui who  both have power levels of 1,500  according to Dyson sure these guys seem  to be a good example for grunts and  freezes army now that we have this  average to go off of let's look at  something Frieza said I cannot believe  how weak my army has grown they can't  even take out that little piece of scrap  referencing Crillon this however I think  is to be taken with a pinch of salt we  all know Frieza can sense power levels  and therefore I think this is a  throwaway s